{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37761","headline":"吊故礼部韦员外序 · 郑谷","name":"吊故礼部韦员外序","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腊雪初晴共举盃，便期携手上春台。\n高情唯怕酒不满，长逝可悲花正开。\n晓奠莺啼残漏在，风帏燕觅旧巢来。\n杜陵芳草年年绿，醉魄吟魂无复回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}